  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Widening of Bertil &#x2013; Harding Highway Phase II Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the overall project (phase I and Phase II) is to contribute to the economic growth of the country by supporting the transport development objective of Increasing the percentage of the primary road network in good condition from 80% to 100% fixed by the country National Development Plant 2018-2021 (NDP). Moreover, the NDP, under the objective the &#x201C;enhanced Land, River, Sea and Air Transport for Affordability, Accessibility, and Competitiveness&#x201D;, Government planned to: review and restructure transport sector policies and institutional framework; develop and implement an integrated transport sector in line with the land use master plan; expand, improve, and maintain the road networks; develop Urban Transport; implement the Banjul port expansion project and develop the inland water ways; implement the Airport Improvement Project; and implement airport hub and city plan

